      "short_description": "Emil Frey France is a prominent automotive distribution group based in Paris, operating as a subsidiary of the Emil Frey Group, which is Europe's largest car retailer. Founded in 1970, the company manages over 322 dealerships across France under the Autosphere network and employs more than 10,000 people. In the last financial report, Emil Frey France achieved sales of €5.9 billion.\n\nThe company specializes in the sale of new and used vehicles from 29 different brands, along with maintenance, repair, and after-sales support. It also offers wholesale automotive equipment, financial services, and vehicle importation. Emil Frey France is actively promoting electric vehicles by installing fast-charging stations at its dealerships and has established partnerships with companies like Atlante France for EV infrastructure and Arval for fleet services. The group is committed to supporting the transition to sustainable mobility in the automotive sector.",
